### 3. Upload Text Document - Valid
# @name uploadValidText
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/{{documentTestAppId}}/documents
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="cover_letter.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

Dear Hiring Manager,

I am writing to express my strong interest in the internship position at your company.

This is a sample cover letter for testing document upload functionality.

Best regards,
Test Applicant
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="document_type"

cover_letter
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

###

### 4. Get Documents for Application
# @name getDocuments
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/{{documentTestAppId}}/documents
Accept: {{contentType}}

###

### 5. Download Document - Get Download URL
# @name downloadDocument
@documentId = use-id-from-upload-response
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/documents/{{documentId}}/download

