### 15. Download Non-Existent Document
# @name downloadNonExistentDoc
@nonExistentDocId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/documents/{{nonExistentDocId}}/download

###

### 16. Download with Invalid Document ID Format
# @name downloadInvalidDocId
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/documents/invalid-uuid-format/download

###

### 17. Delete Document - Valid
# @name deleteDocument
@documentId = use-id-from-upload-response
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/documents/{{documentId}}

###

### 18. Delete Non-Existent Document
# @name deleteNonExistentDoc
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/documents/{{nonExistentDocId}}

###

### 19. Delete Document with Invalid ID Format
# @name deleteInvalidDocId
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/documents/invalid-uuid-format

###

### 20. Get Documents After Deletion
# @name getDocumentsAfterDeletion
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/{{documentTestAppId}}/documents
Accept: {{contentType}}

###

### 21. Download Deleted Document (Should Fail)
# @name downloadDeletedDoc
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/documents/{{documentId}}/download

###

### 22. Upload Large File (Test Size Limits)
# @name uploadLargeFile
