Content-Type: application/pdf

%PDF-1.4
Large file content simulation - this would be much larger in real testing.
This content is repeated multiple times to simulate a large file.
[Content would be repeated many times to reach size limits]
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="document_type"

large_file
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

